 "function": "cloudgen.texture.regime_weights",
 "doc": "All-float32 latitudes (float32 degrees, ratio and gaussians): the float32 chain of the same formulas. Tolerance 1e-4 / 1.5e-5: measured worst difference against float64 1.2e-6, so about 10x. Outputs closed/open/street are the function result; convective (climate.convective_tendency of the latitude in degrees), cold (the cold-air ramp smoothstep(0, 8, |back lat| - |lat|) in degrees) and total_raw (closed + open + street before the normalization, which divides by it where it exceeds 1) are intermediates, there to localize a mismatch; they share the tolerance. params.constants holds the knees and weights written in the code.",
 "params": {
